        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahasha, Muena Amona, wakalua, wakasa tshitudilu bua kuluangana ne musoko wa Yabesha-gilada: bantu bonso ba mu Yabesha bakatumina Nahasha dî ne, Uhunge nʼetu tshihungidi, neakukuatshile mudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahasha, Muena Amona, wakabambila ne, Netuhunge nʼenu dî ku bualu ebu ne buonso buenu nutule mesu enu a ku bianza bia balume: bualu ebu nebuikale bu kusamina kua Bena Isalele bonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakulu ba mu Yabesha bakamuambila ne, Utuheshe matuku muanda mutekete bua tuetu kutuma bamessager ku nseke yonso ya Isalele; nunku bikala kakuyi muntu wa kutusungila, netulue kudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe ba-messager bakalua kudi Shaula ku Gibea, bakamba mei au onso mu matshu a bantu: bantu bonso bakabisha mei abo, bakadila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakafuma ku budimi, wenda ulonda ngombe, wakakonka ne, Bantu badi badidila tshinyi? Bakamuambila mei onso akabambila Bena Yabesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua Shaula mei â, Nyuma wa Nzambi wakamutulukila bikole, ne tshiji tshiandi tshiakatema bikole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakangata ngombe ibidi yakadi ku mutshi wa tshikokedi, wakayisaya munyinyi, wakayituma mu bianza bia miloho ei ku matshika onso a Isalele, Wamba ne, Yonso udi kayi ulonda Shaula ne Samuele, nebenzele ngombe yandi nunku. Ditshina dia Yehowa diakakuata bantu bonso, bakaluhuka diatshimue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakababala mu Bezeke: Bena Isalele bakadi binunu nkama isatu, ne Bena Yuda bakadi binunu makumi asatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakambila miloho yakalua kudibo ne, Nuambile Bena Yabesha-gilada nunku ne, Makelela hafika diba munda munya, nuenu nenusungidibue. Miloho yakalua, yakambila Bena Yabesha dî edi, ne bobo bakasanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Yabesha bakambila Nahasha ne, Makelela netulue kûdi, neubenzele muonso ûdi umona ne mbimpe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatshiabu, Shaula wakatahulula bantu mu bisumbu bisatu; bakafika ku tshitudilu dinda dionso, bakashiha Bena Amona tô ne ku munda munya; bakadi bashala ne muoyo bakamuangalaka, nansha bantu babidi bakashala kaba kamue.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Isalele bakakonka Samuele ne, Nganyi wakamba ne, Shaula neatukokeshe? Lua ne bantu aba, tubashihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaula wakamba ne, Kabena bashiha muntu lelu, bualu bua Yehowa wakamenesha luhandu luandi mu Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele wakambila bantu ne, Luai, tuye ku Gilegala, netujadikileku bukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso bakaya ku Gilegala: bakasungula Shaula mukelenge ku mpala kua Yehowa mu Gilegala; bakafilaku milambu idi ivuisha bantu ditalala ku mpala kua Yehowa; Shaula ne Bena Isalele bonso bakatamba kusankaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
